<title>GERMANY: SIEMENS WINS MANNESMANN MOBILE PHONE ORDER - ADVISORY.</title>
<headline>SIEMENS WINS MANNESMANN MOBILE PHONE ORDER - ADVISORY.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Siemens AG on Friday withdrew a statement announcing it had won a mobile telephone order in Taiwan, saying that its press release was not new and had already been issued in January.</p>
<p>The statement was issued in error instead of another release which said Siemens had won an order to supply equipment for the German D2 mobile phone network operated by Mannesmann Mobilfunk. Reuters has reported separately on this item.</p>
</text>
